sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User/CLI
    participant RunPy as run.py/wsgi.py
    participant CreateApp as create_app()
    participant Extensions as Flask Extensions
    participant Blueprints as Blueprints
    participant Database as Database

    User->>RunPy: Execute run.py or wsgi.py
    RunPy->>CreateApp: Call create_app(config_name)
    CreateApp->>CreateApp: Load configuration
    CreateApp->>Extensions: Initialize extensions
    Note over Extensions: db, bcrypt, login_manager, mail, cors

    CreateApp->>Blueprints: Register blueprints
    Note over Blueprints: auth, main, plaid, posts, financial

    CreateApp->>CreateApp: Register error handlers
    CreateApp->>Database: Create database tables if needed
    Database-->>CreateApp: Tables ready
    CreateApp-->>RunPy: Return Flask app
    RunPy->>User: Run Flask development server